-- New stories: 3 Ireland stories covering the 2019 B2G Peppol
-- mandate anchor, the October 2025 phased domestic B2B mandate
-- announcement (deliberately ahead of the EU's own 2030 deadline),
-- and the February 2026 large-corporate criteria clarification.
-- First stories for Ireland, identified via the country-by-country
-- story-count audit. Sourced to the official Revenue.ie portal.
